A||||1||ejayerik||Too much clutch fluid??||||1||
Z||000000||ejayerik||12-18-2001||03:58 PM||||I looked at the fluid resevour on my 85 2M4 the other day. It is above the full mark. The clutch and master cyl. has been replaced. I have the 5-speed Isuzu trans. What are the symtoms of an over filled clutch? Is it tighter than normal? Does the fluid get warm, thus expand? I don't know much about the clutch...lol...and just want to know if I should drain it some.||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||12-18-2001||06:02 PM||||I doubt that having a little extra fluid in the reservoir will have any ill effects, but I would remove some of the excess fluid anyways.  Just take a clean paper towel and soak up the extra....make sure you don't drip any on the paint!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
